{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1296235-how-many-members-hunters-are-in-a-conspiracy","id":1296235,"title":"How many members/hunters are in a conspiracy?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-03-12T14:23:19-07:00","id":1296235,"title":"How many members/hunters are in a conspiracy?","content":"I am especially interested in how many members have these conspiracies:<br /> <b>Aegis Kai Doru<br /> Ascending Ones<br /> Cainite Heresy<br /> Cheiron Group<br /> Knights of Saint Adrian<br /> Knights of Saint George<br /> Les Myst\u00e8res<br /> Malleus Maleficarum<br /> Task Force: VALKYRIE<br /> Vanguard Serial Crimes Unit</b><br /> <br /> I know there are 666 Lucifuge hunters. But the others? Which conspiracy has the most members? Can the conspiracies be ranked from the biggest to the smallest? How would it look like?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10749-skydiver","name":"skydiver","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-12T15:00:47-07:00","id":1296245,"title":"","content":"Short answer: depends on your ST. Lucifuge may or may not actually have 666\u2014certainly nobody except the Lady of Milan herself would know enough to take an accurate count. Les Myst\u00e8res might be a small local cult with no connection to other Hunters anywhere in the world; the Knights of St Adrian are explicitly an investigation/bounty-hunting group organized by a single person, but that could mean anywhere from five Hunters to a couple hundred, depending how many layers of middlemen Howard has. And nobody has any idea how many Cainites there are, least of all the Cainites themselves.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24808-draconis","name":"Draconis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24808_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"805"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-12T15:36:17-07:00","id":1296253,"title":"","content":"I'd guess that Les Mysteres are by far the largest. They're written as not so much a conspiracy as a type of Hunter group.<br /> <br /> The Ascending Ones are maybe a similar size due to their decentralised structure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-15T06:03:14-07:00","id":1296959,"title":"","content":"Taskforce VALKYRIE was given the count of about six thousand. Two thousand field operatives, and four thousand support personnel.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/274-enokh","name":"Enokh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar274_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-21T00:10:27-07:00","id":1298278,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Enokh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1296235-how-many-members-hunters-are-in-a-conspiracy?p=1296959#post1296959\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Taskforce VALKYRIE was given the count of about six thousand. Two thousand field operatives, and four thousand support personnel.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> 8 thousand according to the core rule book- three quarters of those support staff and administration.<br /> <br /> Anyway to the question, the typical conspiracy is supposed to number 2 to 4 thousand people who include the support/infrastructure for around 750 to 1000 actual hunters, according to the core book. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-22T02:03:58-07:00","id":1298552,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1296235-how